          },
          "description": "From the beloved Christmas brand, Lapland.\n\nDiscover a brand-new collection of magical stories from Lapland – told by none other than Father Christmas himself! Snuggle up and drift off to tales from a wondrous world hidden deep within snowy forests, beneath the glow of the Northern Wish Lights. From moments of wonder to unexpected adventures, each story offers a treasured glimpse into the magical world of Father Christmas, his busy band of Elves, and the charming animals who call Lapland home. Enjoy this new collection of Christmas bedtime stories from Lapland, this festive season.",
